  "body_html": "<h1>Mixed Strategy Simplex</h1>\n<p>For a finite set $S$, the mixed strategy simplex $\\Delta(S)$ is the set of\nprobability vectors on $S$:\n$$\n  \\Delta(S)=\\{x \\in \\mathbb{R}^S : x_s \\ge 0 \\text{ for all } s,\\ \n  \\sum_{s \\in S} x_s = 1\\}.\n$$</p>",
